WEBVTT

00:16.060 --> 00:19.790
Kureha, did you ask Santa for any presents this year?

00:19.790 --> 00:22.540
Santa-san doesn't come to my house.

00:22.540 --> 00:23.000
Eh?

00:23.630 --> 00:25.310
My house is a shrine after all.

00:25.310 --> 00:27.530
We've never even celebrated Christmas.

00:27.530 --> 00:29.000
Let alone believed in Santa-san.

00:29.000 --> 00:30.340
Really?

00:30.340 --> 00:32.480
It can't be helped, I guess.

00:40.060 --> 00:41.760
I just remembered something!

00:41.760 --> 00:43.060
Wait here for a bit!

00:43.490 --> 00:45.790
Really, don't move a muscle, okay?!

00:46.700 --> 00:48.000
Hiiragi!

01:09.000 --> 01:09.880
Kureha!

01:11.550 --> 01:12.590
I'm cold...

01:12.590 --> 01:15.820
You dummy! Why did you stay and let the snow gather on you?!

01:15.820 --> 01:19.510
Because, you told me not to move a muscle.

01:41.490 --> 01:43.640
Come on, don't just look at it, eat it already!

01:47.190 --> 01:48.210
It's really good!

01:48.210 --> 01:50.410
Is that so? I'm glad.

01:50.410 --> 01:52.630
That Santa, you can eat him too you know.

01:53.410 --> 01:56.450
I'll take it home, it's a waste to eat him.

01:56.450 --> 01:57.860
Where's yours?

01:57.860 --> 02:02.360
About mine you see... I just couldn't wait and ate it on the way here.

02:02.360 --> 02:04.740
Don't worry about me, just go on and eat up!

02:06.210 --> 02:07.980
Thank you, Hiiragi!

02:22.020 --> 02:22.950
Kureha...

02:27.790 --> 02:28.980
Good Bye...

04:15.780 --> 04:18.830
Today's tea is Rosehip Tea.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.500
Not bad.

04:25.420 --> 04:28.000
What wind carries you here?

04:28.000 --> 04:31.950
Don't tell me you came all the way here just to wave a white flag.

04:31.950 --> 04:33.770
You must be joking.

04:34.250 --> 04:39.880
You really didn't think that something of this level would scare me, did you?

04:44.170 --> 04:48.020
Well, let's try to set aside our suspicions of each other for the moment, shall we?

04:48.020 --> 04:53.750
If we continue hesitating, both this world and Rikai, everything will be destroyed by <i>him</i>.

04:53.750 --> 04:56.020
The Greater Devil Syaimaar?

04:56.020 --> 05:01.010
That's right, and it was you, the protector of the world, who resurrected it.

05:01.010 --> 05:02.900
The light that destroys everything.

05:04.610 --> 05:06.750
That was not your intention.

05:06.750 --> 05:10.280
You believed that if you gathered all seven jewels, the door to Rikai would open.

05:10.280 --> 05:12.650
And you would be able to save the world.

05:13.240 --> 05:14.350
But you know...

05:14.350 --> 05:17.040
It's about time you began to look at reality, Anzelotte.

05:18.630 --> 05:25.230
The Jewels of Seven Virtues are parts of Syaimaar's power, sealed into seven jewels.

05:25.760 --> 05:31.080
Once all seven jewels are gathered, the power will again become one.

05:31.080 --> 05:33.770
To return to its true nature.

05:33.770 --> 05:36.940
In other words, destruction and despair.

05:41.610 --> 05:43.400
Akabane Kureha.

05:43.400 --> 05:48.240
You accepted Anzelotte's order, and started hunting us too, huh?

05:48.690 --> 05:54.260
Hiiragi, every single Wizard in the world is currently after you and Elis-chan.

05:54.260 --> 05:55.430
I know.

05:55.430 --> 05:59.260
No matter where you run, you will surely be tracked down and found.

05:59.260 --> 06:02.280
No matter how hard you fight, you can't win by yourself!

06:02.280 --> 06:04.670
We won't know that until we try!

06:04.670 --> 06:06.020
Don't be an idiot!

06:06.470 --> 06:08.380
Elis-chan is Syaimaar.

06:08.380 --> 06:11.630
The world is going to be destroyed just by letting her exist!

06:11.630 --> 06:12.700
You're wrong!

06:13.410 --> 06:15.270
Elis is not Syaimaar!

06:15.700 --> 06:18.010
Elis has her own heart.

06:18.010 --> 06:20.000
She has the time spent with us!

06:20.540 --> 06:23.480
She'd never think of destroying the world!

06:24.260 --> 06:26.000
That is what I believe.

06:26.470 --> 06:28.070
Hiiragi-senpai...

06:28.070 --> 06:32.280
Are you saying you can prevent Syaimaar from resurrecting?!

06:34.090 --> 06:35.210
I don't know.

06:35.770 --> 06:40.000
I don't know if I can stop such a great power.

06:40.700 --> 06:42.550
To be honest, I'm really scared.

06:43.190 --> 06:46.370
But I love this world!

06:46.370 --> 06:53.390
I want to protect the memories that I have of the time spent with you, Hiiragi-senpai and Akari-chan!

06:54.470 --> 06:56.620
Don't you understand, Kureha?!

06:56.620 --> 07:00.310
If we let Elis die here, everything we've done will have been meaningless!

07:00.710 --> 07:05.020
The memories we have being friends, the fights we fought to save the world!

07:05.020 --> 07:07.560
You really are stupid, Hiiragi.

07:07.560 --> 07:11.930
You think you can go against every Wizard in the world, yet you still say such naive things.

07:12.780 --> 07:14.450
But you are serious aren't you?

07:15.010 --> 07:17.400
In that case, draw your sword!

07:18.700 --> 07:19.830
Kureha...

07:21.240 --> 07:25.090
Just how serious you are, I'll test that for you.

07:26.140 --> 07:29.280
Hiiragi, it's no use, she's not going to change her mind.

07:29.280 --> 07:32.450
In order to protect Elis, you have no choice.

07:44.670 --> 07:45.900
Hiiragi-senpai!

07:48.320 --> 07:49.490
That's...

07:49.930 --> 07:52.740
The two of you fighting because of me...

07:52.740 --> 07:55.450
Please stop, I'm begging you!

07:57.350 --> 08:00.430
I wonder how things ended up like this.

08:02.200 --> 08:07.670
That the door to save the world would, actually lead to its destruction.

08:07.670 --> 08:11.710
Anzelotte, have you become senile from living too long?

08:11.710 --> 08:13.100
How dare you.

08:13.100 --> 08:18.850
Besides, the fact that the jewel was the key to Syaimaar's resurrection, no one in the world....

08:21.780 --> 08:26.010
"No one could have known." Is that really true, Anzelotte?

08:26.730 --> 08:29.730
Who was the one who gave you the information regarding the jewels?

08:30.090 --> 08:36.030
Who was it that deceived you saying, "Once the seven jewels are gathered the door to Rikai will open"?

08:36.030 --> 08:40.950
He must be quite an idiot to throw around such vague information like that.

08:41.480 --> 08:43.240
That is impossible!

08:43.780 --> 08:45.080
Not <i>him</i>.

08:45.080 --> 08:51.000
Right, the only one from whom you take orders and who never makes mistakes.

08:51.520 --> 08:53.260
There is no way <i>he</i> didn't know about it.

08:53.670 --> 08:55.270
The absolute being.

08:56.160 --> 08:58.460
Let's look at this from another angle.

08:59.090 --> 09:03.480
The one who gave you your orders is the omniscient being.

09:03.480 --> 09:07.400
So it would be natural for <i>him</i> to know about the true nature of the jewels.

09:07.400 --> 09:09.150
And if that's the case, then <i>he</i>...

09:09.790 --> 09:15.570
was planning to use you to resurrect Syaimaar.

09:15.570 --> 09:17.010
This is absurd!

09:17.010 --> 09:20.160
If Syaimaar awakens, the world will be destroyed!

09:20.490 --> 09:23.580
And if <i>that</i> was his true goal?

09:31.840 --> 09:34.200
Stop it, you two!

09:34.200 --> 09:36.750
What are you doing, Hiiragi? Strike now!

09:37.250 --> 09:39.510
At this distance, Akabane Kureha will have the advantage!

09:43.110 --> 09:51.000
Hey, Kureha... I've had enough of victories built on the sacrifices of my friends.

09:51.600 --> 09:56.650
Just because the world might be saved, I cannot allow Elis to die.

09:57.310 --> 10:03.660
And for the same reason, I don't intend to fight you to protect Elis.

10:07.390 --> 10:11.180
My sword is not to be used to cut down my friends.

10:11.720 --> 10:15.120
Shoot me if you want. Do as you like.

10:27.170 --> 10:30.060
You really are stupid, Hiiragi.

10:34.570 --> 10:35.900
Kureha-san...

10:36.440 --> 10:40.070
Geez, and I was so serious about it too.

10:40.070 --> 10:46.580
Rather than letting some random Wizard kill you, with my own hand I was... I was really going to do it you know...

10:47.030 --> 10:48.040
Kureha...

10:48.040 --> 10:51.330
God, did you know how worried I was...?

10:51.330 --> 10:56.550
I was so pissed off, I was thinking of spreading your embarrassing secret all over the Internet.

10:58.790 --> 11:00.300
You never gave up, did you?

11:02.250 --> 11:03.140
Of course.

11:05.100 --> 11:06.600
That's the Hiiragi I know!

11:11.320 --> 11:14.310
Elis-chan, I'm sorry I scared you.

11:14.310 --> 11:18.240
I also believe in you just as Hiiragi does.

11:18.780 --> 11:21.320
Let's all work together to find a better way!

11:22.020 --> 11:23.460
Kureha-san...

11:24.750 --> 11:26.010
Thank you.

11:28.610 --> 11:30.740
Don't cry, Elis-chan.

11:30.740 --> 11:32.580
It is not like you.

11:33.180 --> 11:36.010
Come, come, smile, smile.

11:36.810 --> 11:38.240
This is ridiculous!

11:38.240 --> 11:41.930
There is no way that <i>he</i> planned for Syaimaar's resurrection!

11:42.670 --> 11:47.760
The foremost reason being, that <i>he</i> was the one who gave the order to kill Shiho Elis.

11:47.760 --> 11:56.650
Syaimaar is still incomplete, he might be waiting for the final thing that would trigger the true resurrection of Syaimaar.

11:57.010 --> 12:00.880
But before that happens, Shiho Elis could be killed.

12:00.880 --> 12:03.010
But she hasn't been killed yet.

12:03.530 --> 12:04.520
Am I wrong?

12:05.000 --> 12:09.160
Is Hiiragi Renji the only one protecting Shiho Elis?

12:10.590 --> 12:19.000
It is true that Hiiragi Renji is a powerful Wizard, but he won't be able to live long by making the entire world his enemy.

12:19.000 --> 12:23.130
Is there someone else who is helping him?

12:23.130 --> 12:25.780
Someone... else?

12:27.010 --> 12:31.530
Let's go to my house for the time being, I'll prepare some food and a bath for you.

12:31.530 --> 12:33.960
We should take a rest and think about what to do next...

12:33.960 --> 12:34.890
You can't.

12:34.890 --> 12:35.890
Huh?

12:47.570 --> 12:49.530
Hiiragi... Elis-chan...

12:55.370 --> 12:57.000
Kureha... -san...?

12:57.510 --> 12:58.840
It's no good.

12:59.300 --> 13:02.760
You two should have fought each other.

13:03.760 --> 13:06.550
He is the real Observer of the World.

13:06.550 --> 13:10.500
The one who looks after everything, and finds the way for everything.

13:11.190 --> 13:13.140
The leader of all the protectors.

13:13.950 --> 13:16.060
The Geizer.

13:17.000 --> 13:18.560
That boy is?!

13:18.560 --> 13:23.740
He is destroying everything that he has looked after right now.

13:23.740 --> 13:25.900
And he is trying to change everything...

13:28.270 --> 13:33.340
by using Shiho Elis and Syaimaar's resurrection.

13:37.080 --> 13:40.540
Today must be your greatest birthday, Elis.

13:41.630 --> 13:43.300
Did you forget?

13:43.300 --> 13:46.090
Just as promised, I came to meet you.

13:47.960 --> 13:51.000
I am always looking after you.

13:51.000 --> 13:56.770
I am looking forward to meeting you on your seventeenth birthday.

14:00.480 --> 14:03.640
Happy Birthday, Elis.

14:11.730 --> 14:16.530
For a very long time, I have continued to watch over the world.

14:17.070 --> 14:21.730
Simply watching over mankind and their actions.

14:22.280 --> 14:26.050
And in the end, I fell into despair.

14:26.790 --> 14:28.740
The world is contorted.

14:28.740 --> 14:29.970
The planet is tainted.

14:29.970 --> 14:31.800
Its people are corrupted.

14:31.800 --> 14:36.560
They devour the days like a beast in a cage.

14:36.560 --> 14:39.060
They're only aging the planet.

14:40.470 --> 14:43.270
There is no longer a need to amend.

14:43.270 --> 14:46.280
The only way is to turn everything into nothingness.

14:47.040 --> 14:50.150
You worked hard up to this day, Elis.

14:50.990 --> 14:54.380
I am here to hand you your present.

14:54.380 --> 14:56.800
Just like I promised in my letter.

14:56.800 --> 15:00.830
No way... Kirihito-kun is... Oji-sama?

15:01.240 --> 15:03.080
That's right, Elis.

15:03.480 --> 15:06.250
Oji-sama has... Kureha-san...

15:06.750 --> 15:09.470
Yes, that's right, Elis.

15:09.930 --> 15:11.130
Why?

15:13.240 --> 15:16.260
Because she was no longer useful.

15:17.020 --> 15:23.550
I actually wanted her to fight Hiiragi, and for one of them to die in front of you.

15:26.210 --> 15:30.360
Good grief, they're all just so useless...

15:33.500 --> 15:35.070
Kirihito...!

15:35.920 --> 15:38.700
You bastard!!

15:43.200 --> 15:44.580
That is impossible.

15:44.580 --> 15:48.510
That is against our... against the rule of the world!

15:48.510 --> 15:52.230
We exist only as observers.

15:52.230 --> 15:55.890
We aren't allowed to interfere directly.

15:55.890 --> 16:03.530
Isn't it just borderline from breaking the rules by disguising himself as a boy, thus breaking a little bit of the rule?

16:03.530 --> 16:07.340
Just like what you did with Hiiragi Renji?

16:07.340 --> 16:14.110
But it is certain that he cannot interfere in things that could affect the world.

16:14.540 --> 16:22.250
If the person who brings peace to the world upsets the peace himself? It would be a contradiction to his existence.

16:22.800 --> 16:28.010
Hence, he created Shiho Elis as the vessel for Syaimaar.

16:28.610 --> 16:34.680
So that he didn't do it directly, but by using her as a tool to achieve his goal.

16:39.470 --> 16:45.190
It's no use, before the Shield of God, any attack is powerless.

16:45.190 --> 16:47.020
Shield of... God?

16:58.270 --> 17:00.120
Hiiragi...-senpai...

17:02.670 --> 17:04.540
Kirihito!!!

17:13.150 --> 17:15.340
Kiri...hito!

17:17.510 --> 17:21.220
Hiiragi Renji, you too are an unlucky guy.

17:21.780 --> 17:25.980
Had you not mixed up with Elis, things wouldn't have turned out this way.

17:28.010 --> 17:29.450
It's my fault...

17:30.130 --> 17:31.400
It's because of me that...?

17:31.400 --> 17:33.940
That's right, Elis.

17:34.370 --> 17:35.260
My...

17:36.160 --> 17:37.300
It's my fault...

17:37.300 --> 17:38.660
Yes, that's right.

17:40.080 --> 17:41.510
Kureha-san too...

17:41.510 --> 17:43.910
That's right, even her.

17:44.760 --> 17:46.160
Stop it.

17:47.030 --> 17:49.500
I am... because I am Syaimaar?...

17:49.500 --> 17:54.710
That's right, because you are Syaimaar, everyone around you ended up like this.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.970
Stop it...!

17:57.360 --> 17:59.560
Listen well, Elis.

17:59.560 --> 18:03.660
Everything ended up like this because you are Syaimaar.

18:06.010 --> 18:08.010
Kureha... -san...

18:10.800 --> 18:12.440
Elis...!

18:47.890 --> 18:54.650
That's right, Elis! That fear and despair is the power that awakens you!

19:10.340 --> 19:12.930
Happy Birthday, Syaimaar.

19:12.930 --> 19:15.960
Burn this failed world down!

19:38.340 --> 19:44.410
Anzelotte-sama! In Tokyo, Syaimaar has appeared in Akihabara above Kimei Academy!

19:44.410 --> 19:45.830
What did you say?!

19:53.370 --> 19:55.210
This proves it, right?

19:55.210 --> 19:58.240
That my inferences were correct.

19:59.010 --> 20:01.960
Geizer is, the one who looks after the world.

20:01.960 --> 20:06.260
He must have a reason why this world must be destroyed.

20:06.260 --> 20:09.520
Then why don't you just go and ask him, in person?

20:14.940 --> 20:22.360
That's right, the final key to awaken Syaimaar was... that girl's despair.

20:25.060 --> 20:27.160
Please answer me, Geizer!

20:27.620 --> 20:31.000
Is it really your will that Syaimaar be reawakened?!

20:31.500 --> 20:36.920
Anzelotte, think of what you must do for the sake of the world.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.690
Please answer me!

20:38.690 --> 20:43.600
Did you order me to gather all the jewels so that this will happen?

20:51.460 --> 20:54.130
That's exactly right, Anzelotte.

20:54.130 --> 20:56.060
Everything was my will.

20:56.600 --> 20:58.480
Gei...zer...

20:59.150 --> 21:06.820
By killing Akabane Kureha, I was able to make Elis fall into despair, and awaken Syaimaar.

21:07.250 --> 21:15.500
Actually, I was planning on Akabane Kureha and Hiiragi Renji fighting each other in front of Elis in order to break her down.

21:16.070 --> 21:19.000
But in the end, I had to do it with my own hands.

21:19.520 --> 21:22.630
This world is truly unpredictable.

21:22.630 --> 21:26.000
But that thorn will soon be no more.

21:26.510 --> 21:29.600
Syaimaar will destroy this world for me.

21:30.230 --> 21:34.020
Anzelotte, you will wait until everything is over.

21:34.020 --> 21:38.400
Why?! Why did the Observer of the World like you do this?!

21:38.400 --> 21:42.110
It should be obvious, it's in order to save the world.

21:42.920 --> 21:46.740
No one could save this failed world anymore.

21:47.110 --> 21:51.660
That's why we have to destroy everything, and remake it all over again.

21:52.440 --> 21:53.450
Geizer...

21:54.170 --> 22:01.380
There is no need to worry, the next newborn children will be good obedient kids who will do as they're told.

22:04.670 --> 22:06.170
Geizer, please wait!

22:06.170 --> 22:07.490
Geizer!

22:45.650 --> 22:46.820
Elis...

22:47.760 --> 22:51.010
Stop it, ELIS!!

22:55.350 --> 22:56.770
It's all gone...

22:57.380 --> 23:03.380
My memories, Kureha-san, and Oji-sama, everything...

23:03.980 --> 23:05.100
There's nothing left...

23:08.640 --> 23:11.030
I am Syaimaar.

23:11.550 --> 23:14.780
A monster that has lost its place to return to...

24:51.520 --> 24:55.570
Soon its time will be up, and this failed world will end.

24:56.220 --> 24:58.000
Elis is mine.

24:58.960 --> 25:05.810
The 'fallen man', Hiiragi Renji, there is absolutely nothing you can do.

25:05.810 --> 25:10.940
Next on Night Wizard, THE ANIMATION, The Last Episode - Happy Birthday.

25:11.630 --> 25:14.490
I will protect both Elis and the world!
